{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Her hand cannot reach.</b> Like the sense of \"and his hand cannot reach.\"" "<b>And the priest shall make atonement for her and she shall be clean.</b> This teaches that if the priest does not make atonement for her, she is not clean — and this depends on the land."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:43.798645339Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}